## Notes / Observations

- Initial `rtk helm template` output appeared truncated (only ServiceAccount + CRD). Re-running with the native `/opt/homebrew/bin/helm` binary rendered all 6 resources; this is recorded as a tooling/display artifact, not a chart defect.
- Initial `docker build` attempt failed to locate the jar; a retry immediately succeeded, indicating the failure was transient (likely a stale BuildKit context cache). The Dockerfile and .dockerignore are functionally correct.
- Helm chart uses namespace-scoped Role/RoleBinding, matching the plan's default namespace-scoped operator.
- Operator.java falls back to "default" only when no namespace is supplied and the client reports no namespace; in-cluster execution uses the pod namespace via the downward API (Helm injects OPERATOR_NAMESPACE).

